\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{AB} & =⟨3,2,1⟩-⟨2,1,0⟩ \\\\  & =⟨1,1,1⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nSo, a normal vector to the plane is $n=⟨1,1,1⟩.$ \n\nTherefore, the equation of the plane is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(r-q)\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ r\\cdot n-q\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ r\\cdot n & =q\\cdot n \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨1,1,1⟩ & =⟨2,1,-1⟩\\cdot ⟨1,1,1⟩ \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨1,1,1⟩ & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534878 true] [17592186316974 1000 #edb/ref 17592186316975 13194139534878 true] [17592186316974 1000 #edb/ref 17592186316976 13194139534878 true] [17592186316974 1000 #edb/ref 17592186316977 13194139534878 true] [17592186316974 1000 #edb/ref 17592186316978 13194139534878 true] [17592186316974 1000 #edb/ref 17592186316979 13194139534878 true] [17592186316974 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534878 true] [17592186316974 1041 "selection" 13194139534878 true] [17592186316974 1104 #edb/ref 17592186316975 13194139534878 true] [17592186316974 1110 #uuid "475d5cee-306a-5cd5-b998-795c7327de73" 13194139534878 true] [17592186316975 1034 "r\\cdot ⟨1,1,1⟩=2" 13194139534878 true] [17592186316975 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534878 true] [17592186316975 1111 #uuid "295f1e58-4a16-5d5a-b676-984818a41fed" 13194139534878 true] [17592186316976 1034 "r\\cdot ⟨2,1,-1⟩=⟨1,1,1⟩" 13194139534878 true] [17592186316976 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534878 true] [17592186316976 1111 #uuid "7c31152e-66dd-5fe9-9562-96be7263d661" 13194139534878 true] [17592186316977 1034 "r\\cdot ⟨1,1,1⟩=⟨2,1,-1⟩" 13194139534878 true] [17592186316977 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534878 true] [17592186316977 1111 #uuid "4ea2f177-4c47-5d19-aa6d-d0bf73033d47" 13194139534878 true] [17592186316978 1034 "r\\cdot ⟨2,1,-1⟩=2" 13194139534878 true] [17592186316978 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534878 true] [17592186316978 1111 #uuid "e4b58dd1-3b24-551d-b476-8762f33d28b0" 13194139534878 true] [17592186316979 1034 "r\\cdot ⟨1,1,1⟩=0" 13194139534878 true] [17592186316979 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453